      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving understandability.Now I have a clear picture of the test. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Replacing byte-by-byte comparison loops with `assertArrayEquals`\n2. Introducing a named constant for the 4-byte extra-field header size\n3. Using clearer variable names (`localMerged`, `centralMerged`, `expectedLocal`, `expectedCentral`)\n4. Adding a brief comment explaining the binary layout being constructedThe improved test compiled successfully."
